description=ZENKU R5.4.11 GLOBAL SYSTEM PROPERTY REQUESTS: persist.sys.use_dithering=1 (display visual request, not GPU boost) + persist.sys.purgeable_assets=1 (legacy request; may be ignored on modern Android; no RAM/FPS guarantee); both are in root system.prop and independent of AAA++, Performance and Balance presets. Retains R5.4.9 VISUAL AAA++ PERFORMANCE BALANCE PRESETS + GPU RENDERER API PANEL + VERIFIED CLEAN ZIP BUILD + R5.4.7 LMKD/GAME POLICY + R5.4.6 CPUSET ROM POLICY FIX + DYNAMIC APP PICKER + PQ WEBROOT BUNDLED (opt-in, MT6789): retains R5.1 PHH AutoSingleLayer, SF60ms, manual VSync 60/90Hz, R4.1 visuals and GPU/FPSGo/idle charging; PHH headset detection fix; SF saturation 1.10; LMKD PSI policy (minfree_levels=false, kill_heaviest_task=true, kill_timeout_ms=100, thrashing_limit_decay=50); GameManager default-FPS override disabled only when framework supports it; WebRoot controls PQ contrast/saturation/brightness max=9, Android Boosted and SurfaceFlinger factor; bundled HIDL helper; no gamma/global PQ writes; removes forced top-app 4-7 and SF cpuset migration, preserving ROM/vendor scheduler policy.
